      ],
      "text": "Subject : Representation for pay fixation in the light of IPS ( Pay ) Amendment Rules , 2023 - reg ."
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 7,
      "poly": [
        115.89,
        235.19,
        525.46,
        235.19,
        525.46,
        296.76,
        115.89,
        296.76
      ],
      "text": "The undersigned is directed to refer to Ministry of Home Affairs ' OM No. 16011 / 07 / 2024 - IPS - II dated 19.05.2026 , vide which , the request has been made to relax the prescribed time limit for exercising the option and provide another opportunity to IPS officers who want to re - exercise the option for pay fixation in light of IPS ( Pay ) Amendment Rules , 2023 notified on 05.12.2023 , as a special"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 8,
      "poly": [
        115.89,
        294.35,
        142.9,
        294.35,
        142.9,
        301.11,
        115.89,
        301.11
      ],
      "text": "case ."
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 9,
      "poly": [
        113.98,
        314.87,
        532.39,
        314.87,
        532.39,
        415.08,
        113.98,
        415.08
      ],
      "text": "2. The matter has been examined in this Department in light ofthe extant provisions and reasons / circumstances furnished by MHA . Accordingly , it has been decided to grant a further one - time extension of three months from the date of issuance of this Office Memorandum for exercising / re - exercising the option for pay fixation under the IPS ( Pay ) Amendment Rules , 2023 in respect of the concerned , IPS officers . It is further conveyed that no further request for extension of time or relaxation of conditions for exercising / re - exercising the option shall be entertained under any circumstances . Accordingly , MHA may take further necessary action in the matter ."
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 10,
      "poly": [
        113.5,
        426.19,
        421.52,
        426.19,
        421.52,
        442.13,
        113.5,
        442.13
      ],
      "text": "3. This issues with the approval of the competent authority ."
    },
